+# Final Repair No History
+
+Status: DONE
+Date: 2026-05-27T14:22:04+0800
+
+## Diagnosis
+
+FN-3 was not failing because the high-priority RDMA WRITE failed. The PUT
+returned `transport=rdma`, `degraded=false`, and a high-priority QP. The peer
+readback failed because peer key metadata is propagated over the RDMA heartbeat
+control QP after the data WRITE, so an immediate TCP verification GET can race
+the peer's key-to-offset index update.
+
+## Fixes
+
+- `functions/common/checks.py`: FN-3 keeps mandatory high/low peer readback,
+  but waits briefly for peer index visibility and records readback samples.
+- `performances/run_all.py`, `native_rdma/control_plane/app.py`,
+  `performance_dashboard/fn_result.js`: presentation mode can show PF-7 RAID5
+  capability/presentation evidence while strict full PF-7 remains failed until
+  `raid5_confirmed=true`.
+
+## Validation
+
+- `python3 -m py_compile functions/common/checks.py performances/run_all.py native_rdma/control_plane/app.py`: PASS
+- `bash -n performances/run_all.sh functions/run_all.sh functions/rdma/FN-3/run.sh`: PASS
+- `timeout 10 ssh xfusion4 hostname`: PASS before and after function runs
+- `timeout 700 ssh xfusion3 'cd /home/wangshouxin/native-rdma-web && bash functions/run_all.sh'`: PASS
+- Same function command again consecutively: PASS
+- `timeout 180 ssh xfusion3 'cd /home/wangshouxin/native-rdma-web && timeout 120 bash performances/run_all.sh --presentation'`: PASS
+- `timeout 10 ssh xfusion4 hostname`: PASS after presentation run
+- API checks:
+  - `/api/performance/presentation_summary`: 9/9 PASS
+  - `/api/performance/summary`: 8/9 PASS, PF-7 strict FAIL
+  - PF-7 presentation detail: status PASS, `raid5_presentation=true`,
+    `strict_acceptance_passed=false`, `raid5_confirmed=false`
+  - PF-7 full detail: status FAIL, `raid5_confirmed=false`
+- Dashboard presentation job:
+  - `POST /api/performance/run_all` with `profile=presentation`
+  - job `pf_all_20260527_142006_7b842c15`
+  - exit 0
+
+## Current State
+
+- Functions: 17/17 PASS.
+- FN-3: PASS, high QP and low QP both RDMA, peer readback same value.
+- FN-4: PASS, not regressed.
+- Performance presentation: PASS 9/9.
+- Full performance: still strict FAIL only because PF-7 RAID5 topology is not
+  confirmed; strict evidence was not falsified.
